  "id": "sociosexual-orientation",
  "term": "sociosexual orientation",
  "definition": "Sociosexual orientation is a personality characteristic describing how much emotional commitment a person typically wants before engaging in sexual relationships. A more unrestricted sociosexual orientation means needing less commitment and being more inclined toward short-term rather than long-term relationships.",
